      "title": "Transforming news articles to be AI agent friendly",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/transforming-news-articles-to-be-ai-agent-friendly/",
      "published": "Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:38:41 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>Media businesses are eyeing the revenue potential for AI licensing – but they need to make their news content suitable for action-focused agents.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/transforming-news-articles-to-be-ai-agent-friendly/\">Transforming news articles to be AI agent friendly</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
