      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/how-the-athletic-won-the-world-cup-by-gamifying-its-football-coverage/",
      "published": "Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:10:00 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>The World Cup brings huge audiences, but keeping them engaged takes more than match coverage. The Athletic combined free access, interactive games and a focus on its app to encourage fans to return throughout the tournament.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/how-the-athletic-won-the-world-cup-by-gamifying-its-football-coverage/\">How The Athletic won the World Cup by gamifying  its football coverage</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
      "source": "WAN-IFRA"
    },
